OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist children's care home   
OL,4,Aplan approved                          
OL,6,FA specialist care home for young people
OL,7,Fwith autism is to be created after     
OL,8,Fplans were given the go-ahead.         
OL,10,FCommunity interest company Include In  
OL,11,FAutism applied to convert Highgate     
OL,12,FCottage, off Durham Road in Barnes,    
OL,13,FSunderland.                            
OL,15,FIt plans to create a permanent         
OL,16,Fresidential home for up to two children
OL,17,Faged five to 17 with autism and        
OL,18,Fadditional needs, the Local Democracy  
OL,19,FReporting Service said.                
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
