OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist children's care home   
OL,4,Aplan approved                          
OL,6,FReform UK-led Sunderland City Council's
OL,7,Fplanning department approved the       
OL,8,Fproposal, saying it was in a suitable  
OL,9,Flocation and would not have a          
OL,10,Fdetrimental impact on neighbours,      
OL,11,Fnearby roads or the "visual amenity of 
OL,12,Fthe area".                             
